with \eqn{t c_j} in place of \eqn{t} and \eqn{\lambda/c_j} in place of
\eqn{\lambda}. Under a diagonal map the step is \eqn{t d_j^2}, so the
condition becomes \eqn{t c_j d_j^2 < a - 1} in every coordinate, which is
